"title": "i-am",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "iam",
"language": "tpi",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Insait long Olpela Testamen, taim God i singautim Moses, Moses i askim God long wanem nem bilong em. Orait God i tok: &quot;Mi, mi stap.&quot; O, God i ken minim tu olsem &quot;Mi em mi stap na mi bai stap.&quot; Long tok ples Hibru bilong Olpela Testamen, dispela ansa bilong God i saun olsem <a href=\"#t174\">Yahweh</a>. Dispela wod Yahweh i kamap nem we ol Israel i save yusim long God. Olgeta taim ol Israel i harim dispela wod &quot;Mi, mi stap,&quot; ol i tingim dispela nem bilong God. Insait long Nupela Testamen, Jisas i tokim ol manmeri olsem &#x27;bipo long Abraham i bon, Mi, mi stap.&quot; Ol Ju o Judamanmeri husat i harim dispela i tingim nem Yahweh. Ating ol i luksave olsem Jisas i wok long tokim ol manmeri olsem em yet em i God. I gat ol narapela ples tu we Jisas i toktok long em yet taim em i tok &quot;Mi, mi...&quot; sampela samting. Eksampel, Jisas i tok, &quot;Mi, mi rot,&quot; o &quot;Mi, mi bret bilong laip.&quot; Em i ken tru tu olsem olgeta taim Jisas i tok &quot;Mi, mi stap,&quot; em i wok long soim ol manmeri olsem em i God.</p>",
