{
"content_id": "tpi-t72-v1",
"reference_id": 0,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "idol",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "idol",
"language": "tpi",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Wanpela <b>aidol</b> em i wanpela samting we ol manmeri i mekim long <a href=\"#t149\">wosipim</a> wanpela god. Dispela samting i mekim ol manmeri i tingim sampela samting long dispela god. Insait long Baibel, dispela em sampela taim ol i kolim olsem &quot;ol imij o ol piksa nating.&quot; Ol manmeri i mekim wanpela samting-wanpela imij-bilong wanpela god na wosipim dispela samting olsem em i dispela god. Ol manmeri i ken mekim wanpela samting long ston, plang, o metel. Dispela kain samting em i ken luk olsem wanpela man o meri, o olsem wanpela animal, o em i ken gat ol kainkain seip. Ol i ken bikpela tru, o ol i ken liklik na isi long karim. Dispela wod aidol em i ken toktok tu long ol samting o tingting we ol manmeri i wosipim moa long God em yet.</p><p>God i tambuim <b>ol Israel</b> insait long ol komanmen bilong em long no ken mekim dispela kain aidol, o piksa, o wanpela narapela samting na wosipim. Ol i mas wosipim em tasol.</p>",
