{
"content_id": "tpi-t222-v1",
"reference_id": 0,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "image-of-god",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "imageofgod",
"language": "tpi",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Wanpela imij em i piksa bilong wanpela samting. Wanpela foto, wanpela peinting, o wanpela stetyu bilong wanpela man o meri em i imij bilong wanpela man o meri. Dispela imij i tokim yumi long wanem we dispela man o meri i luk, o wanem em i pasin bilong em.</p><p>Taim <a href=\"#t189\">God</a> i krietim manmeri, God i tok &quot;yumi mekim man long imij bilong yumi. Ol manmeri bai lukim olsem yumi. Na ol manmeri bai bosim olgeta ol animal na plent long graun.&quot;</p><p>Olsem na, olgeta manmeri em God i wokim ol long piksa bilong em. Dispela em i no min olsem long sait bilong bodi em yumi luk olsem God, bikos God em i spirit na i no gat bodi olsem yumi gat. Tasol em i min olsem ol manmeri i representim God long graun. God i bin givim ol manmeri wok long lukautim graun. Ol manmeri i sapos long lukautim ol animal, ol plent, na olgeta neitsa, long nem bilong God, o i makim God na i lukautim ol dispela samting.</p><p>Insait long Nupela Testamen, yumi lainim olsem Jisas em i nambawan imij bilong God. Yumi no inap long lukim God, tasol yumi ken lukim Jisas, na taim yumi lukluk long Jisas, yumi save wanem em ol pasin bilong God. Olsem ol folowa bilong Jisas yumi mas kamap ol imij bilong Jisas-yumi mas luk moa na moa olsem Jisas.</p>",
