{
"content_id": "tpi-t293-v1",
"reference_id": 0,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "immorality",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "immorality",
"language": "tpi",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Taim ol manmeri i mekim ol kainkain seksuel sin, yumi save tok olsem ol i <b>imorel</b>. Taim wanpela marit man o wanpela marit meri i gat seksuel rilesensip autsait long marit bilong em, yumi tok olsem em i wok long komitim adaltri. Tasol, taim Baibel i tok olsem wanpela man o meri i mekim imorel samting, em i min olsem ol i mekim kainkain seksuel sin. Planti taim, taim wanpela man o meri i imorel, ol i wok long mekim sampela kain seksuel sin taim ol i no marit. Sampela taim, ol ota o man i raitim stori i yusim dispela tok &quot;imorel&quot; long toktok long ol manmeri husat i save wosipim ol <b>aidol</b> na i no wosipim God. Wankain tasol olsem ol man o meri we i no feitful long wanpela narapela taim ol i mekim seksuel sin, wanpela man o meri husat i wosipim wanpela giaman god o aidol na i no wosipim trupela God em i no feitful. Yumi ken kolim ol dispela manmeri olsem ol i imorel tu.</p>",
"associations": {
"passage": [],
"resource": [],
"acai": []
}
},
{
"content_id": "tpi-t159-v1",
"reference_id": 0,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "inn",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "inn",
"language": "tpi",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Wanpela <b>in o haus pasindia</b> em i wanpela jenerel wod bilong wanpela ples we ol travela i ken stap long en. Dispela em i ken wanpela ples we ol manmeri i nid long baim sampela mani na bai ol i ken stap long hap, tasol planti taim em i min wanpela rum insait long haus bilong sampela lain we ol i putim i stap bilong ol lain i kam lukim ol. Taim ol wantok o pren i kam long visit, ol i ken stap insait long dispela rum.</p>",
"associations": {
