{
"content_id": "tpi-t73-v1",
"reference_id": 0,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "isaiah",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "isaiah",
"language": "tpi",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p><b>Aisaia</b> em i wanpela <a href=\"#t104\">profet</a> husat i bin stap 700 yia bipo long Jisas. Wanpela profet em i wanpela man o meri husat i save givim tok save bilong God i go long ol manmeri. Planti bilong ol mesej o toktok bilong Aisaia em ol i bin raitim i go daun na yumi kenn harim ol insait long buk we ol i kolim Aisaia.</p><p>Long dispela taim we Aisaia i bin stap, <a href=\"#t94\">nesen</a> bilong <a href=\"#t74\">Israel</a> em i bin divaid o bruk i go long tupela hap. Noten hap em ol i bin kolim Israel, na sauten hap em ol i bin kolim Judah<b></b>. Planti taim, Aisaia i bin givim ol mesej i go long ol manmeri bilong Judah. Planti ol manmeri long Judah i bin <b>wosipim</b> ol giaman <a href=\"#t235\">god</a>, na ol i no bin bihainim ol gutpela rul we God i bin givim ol. Aisaia i bin givim tok lukaut long ol manmeri agen na agen olsem ol i mas <b>ripent o tanim bel</b> na stat long harim tok bilong God, bikos God bai panisim ol. Tasol Aisaia i givim tu ol mesej bilong hop. Em i tokim ol olsem God bai salim wanpela man i kam husat bai mekim ol samting i kamap stret gen. God i fulfilim ol dispela promis bilong mekim ol samting i rait gen insait long Jisas.</p>",
"associations": {
