{
"content_id": "tpi-t259-v2",
"reference_id": 0,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "israelite",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "israelite",
"language": "tpi",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p><b>Ol Israel</b> em <b>ol lain tumbuna</b> bilong Jekob. <a href=\"#t1\">Abraham</a>, tumbuna papa bilong Jekob, em i wanpela man husat i bin stap 2000 yia bipo long Jisas i bon. Taim Abraham i bin gat 75 krismas, God i toktok long em. God i tokim em long lusim as ples bilong em, na go long wanpela ples we God bai soim long em. God i tok olsem em bai blesim Abraham, na em bai mekim wanpela bikpela <a href=\"#t94\">nesen</a> o lain manmeri i kamap long Abraham, na God bai yusim Abraham long <a href=\"#t16\">blesim</a> olgeta lain manmeri long olgeta hap bilong God. Abraham i harim na bihainim tok bilong God na God i lidim em i go long rijen o eria we ol i kolim <a href=\"#t178\">Kenan</a> long dispela taim. God i bin promisim Abraham olsem God bai givim dispela graun i go long ol lain tumbuna bilong Abraham. Abraham na meri bilong em i no bin gat wanpela pikinini, tasol taim Abraham na meri bilong em i lapun olgeta, God i givim tupela wanpela pikinini man, Aisak. Dispela em i stat bilong God i fulfiim promis bilong em long Abraham.</p><p>Pikinini man bilong Abraham, Aisak i gat wanpela pikinini man na nem bilong em Jekob. Bihain God i givim Jekob dispela nem Israel. Stat long dispela taim na i go, olgeta lain tumbuna bilong Jekob em ol i kolim ol, ol Israel. Jekob i gat 12-pela pikinini man, olsem na ol Israel em ol i divaid o bruk i go long 12-pela traib: Ruben, Simeon, Livai, Juda, Isakar, Sebulun, Dan, Naptali, Gad, Asar, Josep, na Benjamin. Traib bilong Josep i divaid o bruk i go long tupela &quot;hap traib&quot;: Efraim na Manaseh.</p><p>Bikos God i bin mekim wanpela promis long Abraham, na bihain long Aisak na Jekob, olsem ol Israel em ol spesel manmeri bilong God. God i bin mekim wanpela <a href=\"#t29\">kavanen</a> wantaim ol, dispela em i wanpela promis we i kam wantaim wanpela spesel agrimen. Dispela agrimen em i olsem ol Israel bai bihainim olgeta <b>ol komanmen</b> bilong God, na God bai blesim ol na mekim ol i kamap wanpela blesing long olgeta manmeri bilong graun.</p><p>Dispela graun we ol Israel i bin stap long en em ol i bin kolim <a href=\"#t74\">Israel</a>. Dispela graun em ol i divaidim o brukim namel long ol kainkain traib bilong Israel. Pastaim, ol manmeri we ol i kolim ol olsem &quot;ol jas&quot; i bin rulim o bosim ol Israel. Taim ol manmeri i bin askim God long givim ol wanpela <a href=\"#t226\">king</a>, God i bin makim wanpela king long bosim ol. Pastaim olgeta samting i go gut, aninit long rul o wok lida bilong king <a href=\"#t33\">Devit</a> na pikinini man bilong em Solomon, kingdom bilong Israel i bin kamap bikpela na i bin gat planti mani samting. Tasol taim king Solomon i dai, i bin gat hevi. Tenpela bilong ol 12-pela traib o hauslain i no laik long larim pikinini man bilong king Solomon i stap olsem king bilong ol. Ol i seperet o bruk long narapela tupela traib o hauslain na i makim king bilong ol yet.</p><p>Long dispela taim i go, Israel i bin bruk. Noten pat, wantaim 10-pela traib o hauslain, em ol i kolim em olsem Israel yet. Sauten pat, wantaim tupela traib o hauslain, em ol i kolim olsem <b>Judah</b>. Ol i kolim em olsem Juda bikos traib bilong Juda em i bin wanpela bilong tupela bikpela traib we i bung wantaim na kamapim dispela sauten <a href=\"#t157\">kingdom</a> o kingdon long saut.</p><p>Wanwan pat i bin gat king bilong ol yet. <a href=\"#t94\">Nesen</a> bilong Asaria i bin winim noten pat, Israel, kain olsem 700 yia bipo long Jisas i bon. Dispela i bin kamap bikos ol manmeri i wok long sakim tok bilong God na brukim kavanen. King bilong ol Asaria i bin salim planti bilong ol manmeri bilong Israel i go long ol narapela kantri. Dispela em i bin pinis bilong noten kingdom. Yumi no inap harim moa long wanem samting i kamap long ol dispela manmeri.</p><p>Kingdom bilong Juda i stap longpela taim liklik, tasol bihain long sampela yia, God i panisim ol tu long sakim tok. Wanpela narapela kantri, ol Babilon, i bin kam na bagarapim siti <a href=\"#t76\">Jerusalem</a>, na ol lain Babilon i kisim ol manmeri bilong Juda i go kalabus long Babilon. Ol manmeri bilong Judah em nau ol i kolim ol olsem <b>Ju o Judalain</b>, we i min olsem &quot;ol manmeri bilong Juda.&quot; Bihain, God i larim ol Ju i go bek long Juda, we ol i bildim gen siti Jerusalem na <a href=\"#t138\">tempel</a>. Tasol Juda bai no inap kamap wanpela indipenden kingdom gen. Long taim bilong Nupela Testamen, wanpela narapela nesen nem bilong em Rom i bin rulim o bosim dispela eria we i bin Israel bipo. Dispela hap we i bin sauten kingdom bilong Juda, em nau ol i kolim olsem <a href=\"#t81\">Judea</a>, wanpela provins bilong Rom. Dispela hap we i bin noten kingdom bilong Israel, em nau ol i kamap olsem ol provins <a href=\"#t221\">Samaria</a> na <a href=\"#t55\">Galili</a> bilong Rom. Dispela wod Ju o Judamanmeri em ol i wok long stat long yusim long kolim olgeta lain tumbuna bilong Jekob we i stap yet, maski ol i stap long wanem hap.</p>",
